      "message": "For some reason, this code was causing a reset on a sysjump:\n[3.035100 Jumping to image RW]\n[3.039200 HC Suppressed: 0x97\u003d0 0x98\u003d0 0x113\u003d0 0x103\u003d0 0x115\u003d0 0x2b\u003d0 0x67\u003d0 0x121\u003d0]\n*** Booting Zephyr OS build zephyr-v2.5.0-89-g58b38fe66d37  ***\n\n--- UART initialized after reboot ---\n[Image: RW, trogdor_zephyr_v2.0.8881+990ee2 2021-05-20 09:00:15 shurst@shurst2]\n[Reset cause: reset-pin]\n\nuart:~$ sysinfo\nReset flags: 0x00000002 (reset-pin)\nCopy:   RW\nJumped: no\nFlags:  unlocked\n\n\nBut with the patchset 8:\n\nUART initialized after sysjump]\n[Image: RW, trogdor_zephyr_v2.0.8881-b29d3d 2021-05-20 16:09:03 shurst@shurst2]\n[Reset cause: soft sysjump]\n\n uart:~$ sysinfo\nReset flags: 0x00000420 (soft sysjump)\nCopy:   RW\nJumped: yes\nFlags:  unlocked",
